"DBA-COF-Gauss: seeded Gaussian launch around fresh COF, one bare turn; reference state, centered bunch, energy and population checks."
stat "numParticles" last 1e-12
stat "energy" last 1e-9
stat "t" last 1e-5
stat "s" last 1e-8
stat "ref_x" last 1e-9
stat "ref_y" last 1e-9
stat "ref_z" last 1e-9
stat "ref_px" last 1e-10
stat "ref_py" last 1e-10
stat "ref_pz" last 1e-10
stat "charge" last 1e-25
stat "mean_x" last 1e-7 # m: tolerate sample-dependent nonlinear centroid motion
stat "mean_y" last 1e-7 # m
stat "mean_s" last 1e-7 # m
